    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="a01859" kindref="compound">E4</ref> structure for <ref refid="a00507" kindref="compound">EAS</ref> with linear strains and 4 enhanced modes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="a01859" kindref="compound">E4</ref> structure represents an implementation of <ref refid="a00507" kindref="compound">EAS</ref> for a specific case where linear strains are considered, and the method includes enhancement with 4 additional modes to improve the accuracy of finite element solutions.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>GEO</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The geometry type. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
